-- Complete procedures for Alterna_MobileMoneyTransfer.
-- ADDED / CHANGED comments identify the changes from the supplied procedures.
-- No transfer statuses or table columns are added.
--
-- Integration requirements:
--   processTransfer: first UpdateTransfer before T24 -> IsInitialAction = true.
--   submit, result updates, error updates and background final updates -> false.
--   Initial OSB GetTransfer lookup: reference only; status/expiry filters unset.
--   Background: call OSB only when usp_ExpireTransfer returns P__RowCount = 1.
--   Customer pending lists: omit rows without a completed sender posting.
--
-- Review assumptions:
--   TransferReference uniquely identifies a row.
--   Existing GETDATE()/CreatedDate time convention is retained.
--   EXPIRED -> EXPIRED is for the reserved background expiry call; it is not
--   an idempotency guarantee for arbitrary repeated expiry requests.
--   The initial branch uses direct OUTPUT INSERTED.*. If t_Transfer has enabled
--   UPDATE triggers, adapt this to OUTPUT INTO before running it.
--   No procedures have been executed against the user's database.

